<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Romte</book>
  <para style="h">Romte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Romte</para>
  <para style="toc2">Romte</para>
  <para style="mt">Romte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Jesu Khrist sikha, sawltak hi ding a sap, Pathian Tanchinhoih lam a khenkhiak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in tuma lam a Laisiangthou a a zawlneite a a chiamsa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tapa, salam a David suan a piang tungtang thu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah Pathian Tapa hihna bel misi lak a kipan thilhihtheihna toh a thohnawnna ziak a siangthouna Kha in Jesu Khrist, Toupa chi a a phuankhiak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A min ziak a ginna namchih lak a mi gingtasak ding in, amah ziak in hehpihna leh sawltak hihna i tangta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />huai lak ah nou leng Jesu Khrist sapte na hi uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rome khua Pathian deihtak, misiangthou a om ding a sapte tengteng kiang ah: Pathian i Pa leh Toupa Jesu Khrist kiang a kipan hehpihna leh lemna na kiang uah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amasa in khovel tengteng ah na ginna uh a than ziak in na vek ua tung a ka kipahthu Jesu Khrist ziak in ka Pathian kiang ah ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thumnate ah tawplou in na min uh ka lou nilouh ahi chih kei hon theihpihpa Pathian ahi a, amah ahi a Tapa Tanchinhoih gen a ka kha a a na ka sep gige pa pen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu bek a na kiang ua ka hong theihna ding in Pathian thuthu a zinhun lemtang ka muh teitei theihna ding ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kipna ding ua khalam thilpiak banghiam nou ka honpiak theihna ding in nou honmuh ka ut thei mahmah ngal hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai na ginna uh leh ka ginna a i kikhamuan tuah theihna ding ka chihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unaute aw, Jentel dangte kiang a ka sepgim gah ka muhtak bangmah in, noumau lak ah leng gahte ka muh theihna ding in na kiang uah tamveipi hong ka tumta chih na theihlouh uh ka deihkei hi; himahleh tuma teng in dal in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Grik mite leh melmak mite kiang ah bat ka nei a; mi pil leh mi pilloute kiang ah leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in nou Rome khua a omte kiang ah leng Tanchinhoih gen ka ut mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tanchinhoih tuh ka zahpih kei a; kuapeuh a gingta phot ading in hotdamna ding a Pathian thilhihtheihna ahi ngal a; a tung in Judami adin ahi a, huan Grik mi ading in leng a hong hinawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huai ah tuh gin semsemna ding in ginna in Pathian diktatna latsak in a om hi; “Midiktat tuh ginna in a hing ding,” chi a gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thutak dikloutak a dalte leh Pathian limsaklouhna leh diktatlouhna tengteng tung ah van a kipan in Pathian thangpaihna a hong kilangta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian in a theihsak tak ziak in Pathian tanchin theihtheih ding tuh a lungsim uah chiangtak a theihsak in a om ngalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khovel siamtung a kipan a pianken muhtheihlouh, a tangtawn thilhihtheihna leh a Pathianna, thilsiamte ah chiantak a muhtheih ahi; huaiziak in paulam ding a neikei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian thei ngal in Pathian bang in a pahtawi kei ua. A kipahthu leng a gensam kei uhi; thil thulimlou a ngaihtuah zawta ua, a lungtang hai uh a hong mialta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pil kisa khem in mihai a hongsuak ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />setheilou Pathian thupina a sethei mihingte leh vasate, gamsate leh bokvak ganhingte lim a suaksak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaiziak in a sa uh zumhuaipi a kibawltuah ding in a lungtang uh duhgawlna bang a thilnin hihphal in Pathian in a lehngatsan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian thutak tuh zuau tangsak in, a bawlpa biak sang in a bawl bia in a na a sem uhi. A bawlpa tuh tangtawn a phat tuak ahi, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huaiziak in Pathian in zumhuaipi a huk phal in lehlam a ngatsanta hi; a numeite nangawn un leng a omdan pianpih uh danlou bang a om ding in a kibawl lamdang uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />pasalte’n leng numei zatdan ngeina tawpsan in, huk in a kienlah ua, pasal leh pasal zummawh thilhih in a om ua, a gitlouh man muh ding uh tuh a satung uah a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan Pathian theih a utlouh ziak un, thil kilawmloute hih ding a a deihlouh lam lungsim neih phal in Pathian in a lehngatsanta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in diktatlouhna, gitlouhna, huaihamna, huatna in a dim ua; hazatna, tualthahna, kiselna, khemna, nundan hoihlou in a dim uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />gensiatnate, migennate, Pathian huatlamte, kisaktheihnate, kisatheimite, thil gilou bawlkhete,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />nu leh pa thu mangloute, theihna beite, thuchiam susete, itna pianpih neiloute, hehpihna neiloute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huchibang hihte tuh sitak ahi uh chih Pathian dan tuh theigige in, amau kia a hih leng hilou in, midang hih zelte tung ah leng a kipak uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaiziak in mihing aw, mi selhat kuapeuh himahlechin paulam himhim na neikei hi. Midang na selna mah ah nangmah leh nangmah siamlouh kitangsak na hi. Nang selhat in leng huchibang thilte na hih sam ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Huchibang thilhih nakte tung ah Pathian vaihawmna diktak in a tung” chih i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing aw, huchibang thilhih nakte gensia, nang leng huchibang na hihsam ngal nak a, Pathian vaihawmna pelh na kigingta ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihkeileh Pathian hoihna kisikna a nang hon pidinga om ahi chih theilou in, a hoihna, a thuaktheihna leh, a dohtheihna hauhnate na ngaineu ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh na lungtang khauh leh kisik utlouhnate ziak in, na tung ah thangpaihna na kholkhawmte Pathian vaihawmna diktat hong kilatna, thangpaihna ni chiang a ding in kholkhawm ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian in michih a thilhih bangzel un a hawmsak ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thil hoih hih teitei a, thupina leh pahtawina leh manthat theihlouhna zong mite kiang ah tangtawn hinna a pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh genhakte, thutak zuilou a, gitlouhna zui zawte tung ah, hehna leh thangpaihna, haksatna leh lungkhamna thupitak a om dia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing thil hihkhial tengteng kha tung ah a om ding, Judami kha tung ah a om masa dia, huan, Grik mi kha tung ah a om nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh, thil hoih hih peuhmahte kiang ah thupina, pahtawina, khamuanna piak ahi ding, Judami kiang ah piak ahi masa dia, huan, Grik mi kiang ah ahi nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in mi deihsaktuam a nei ngal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kuapeuh dan neilou a thil hihkhial, dan lou in a mangthang ding hi; kuapeuh dan nei a thil hihkhial dan a vaihawm in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dan zami phette Pathian mitmuh in midik ahi kei ua; dan zuite midik ahizaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dan neilou Jentelte’n amau pianpih a dan thilte a hih un, amau dan neikei mahle uh, amau leh amau dan in a kinei tawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A lungtang uah dan thilhih gelh ahi chih langsak ding in a sialehpha theihna un a theihpih hi; a lungsimte un leng theihpih ahihman in a ngaihtuahna un siamlouh a tangsak hiam siam a tangsak zel hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka Tanchinhoih gen bang in, Pathian vaihawmni chiang in mihing thugukte, Jesu Khrist tawn in a ngaihtuah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh nang Juda kichi na hi a, dan a kinga in Pathian na suang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A deihlam na thei a, thil hoihzawte hoih na sa a, dan a hilh in na om hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangmah mittawte pipa, miallak a omte vakna hi in na kigingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dan ah pilna leh thutak omdan na theih ziak in, mipilloute hilhpilpa, naungekte hilhpa in na kigingta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchibang na hih ngal leh nang midangte hilhpa, nangmah na kihilh ka hia? Nang mi guta lou dia hilhpa, nang na gu nak maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang angkawm lou dia hilhpa, nang ang na kawm maw? Nang milim hawpa, nang milim biakin a thilte na gu nak maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang dan suangpa, nang dan a na tatlek ziak in Pathian na hihminse zel ahi maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Pathian min noumau ziak in Jentelte lak ah gensiat in a omta hi” chi a kigelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Dan zuipa na hihleh zeksum a phatuam ngial hi; dan a talekpa na hih lebel, na zeksum sum louh bang phet a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huaiziak in, zeksum lou mi in danthusehte a zuih leh a zeksum louh sum bang a sim ahi kei dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan amau sa a zeksum louh in dan a zuih kim uleh, nang danthu gelh leh zeksum nei ngal a dan a talekpa a hon mawhpaih kei ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A lang lel a Judami hi zaw Judami tak ahi kei hi; a lang a sa lel a zeksum zaw zeksum tak leng ahi sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Himahleh a lang lel hilou a, Judami hi, Judami tak ahi; huan zeksum tak, lungsim a sum ahi, laithu phet ah hilou in, kha ah ahi; huai mi’n mihing phat a loh kei a, Pathian phat a loh zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahihleh Juda mi’n hamphat tuamna bang ahia a neih tuan? Zeksum leng bang ahia a phattuamna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Koi lam peuh ah a phatuam hi; Pathian thute a kiang ua kep sak a a om ziak ahi pen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi khenkhatte’n ginna neikei mahle uh, bang ahi tuan a eita? A gintak louhna un Pathian muanhuaina bangmahlou in a bawl tuan ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawl tuan lou hial; Pathian mi diktak hita hen, michih zuauthei hi uhen: “Nang na thugen in siam na tanthei a, vaihawma na om in leng na zoh theihna ding in,” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh i diktatlouhna in Pathian diktatna a hihlat hoih sem leh, bang i gen dia? Pathian in mi a gawt in, mi diktatlou ahi hia? Mihing dan bang in ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hilou hial: huchibang hihleh, Pathian in khovel vai bangchi’n a hawm dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh ka zuauthu gen ziak a Pathian thu dik dan amah hihthupi khop hial a a latsem ngal leh, bang a chia keileng mikhial bang a siamlouh tansak a omlai ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bang a chia, hon hek ua, mi khenkhat in genlouhpi hon gensak bang un. “Thil hoih hongtun theihna ding in thil gilou i hih ding uh” chi a i gen zawk louh? Huchibang ching mite’n siamlouh a tan uh a dik him ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihleh amau sang in i hoihzaw khol ua hia? Hoihzaw lou hial; Judate leh Grikte khelhna sikha a omvek in tuma in leng i ngohta vele;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kuamah mi diktat himhim a omkei uh, khat leng a omkei uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kuamah theisiam himhim a omkei uh, kuamah Pathian zong himhim a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hilou lam ah a pialkhinta ua, bangmah phatuamlou in a om khinta ua, kuamah thil hoih hih himhim a omkei uh, khat leng a omkei uh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“A gawl uh han kihong ahi a; a lei un zekhemna thu a gen uhi.” “A kam sung uah gul gu a om hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“A kam uh hamse lohna leh thukha in a dim hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“A khe uh sisan suah ding in a kin suan uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A lampi uah manthatna leh gimthuakna a om a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khamuanna lampi a theikei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A mit uah Pathian launa a omkei,” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dan in bangpeuh a gen, danthuthu a omte kiang ah a gen ahi chih i thei uhi; kam chiteng a hum theihna ding in leh khovel a mi tengteng Pathian vaihawm a a om theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in “Dan thilhihte ziak in mi kuamah a mitmuh in siamtang in a omkei ding uhi;” dan tawn in khelhna theihna a hongom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh tun bel dan leh zawlneite na theihsak Pathian dikna dan tellou a hihlat in a omta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai tuh Jesu Khrist gintak ziak a, a gingtate tengteng adia Pathian diktatna ahi. Lamdanna himhim a omkei:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi tengteng in thil a hihkhelh ziak ua Pathian thupina a tan zohlouh nung un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a om tatna ziak in, hehpihna a a thawna siamtansak in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amah tuh a sisan ziak a thuphatawina hi in, ginna a muh ding in Pathian in a luikheta hi. Hiai tuh Pathian dikna latsakna ding ahi, aman a dohtheihna ziak a nidanglai khelhnate a Paikan tak ziak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan amah ngei a dik a, chih leh Jesu a ginna neimi siam a tangsak chih chetna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na kiotsakna uh koi a om ahia leh? Pawsiah in a omta hi. Bang dan in ahia leh? Thilhihna dan in hia? Hilou hial, ginna dan in ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in dan thilhihte ziak hilou in, ginna in min siamtansak in a om chi in i sep uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian, Judate Pathian kia hia? Jentelte Pathian leng ahi sam ka hia? Hi e, Jentelte Pathian leng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian khat kia a hih ziak in; aman zeksumte a ginna ziak un, zeksumlouhte a ginna ziak un siam a tangsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi ahihleh dan bangmahlou in i bawl ua hia? Bawllou hial. Dan tuh i hihkip zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahihleh Abraham, sa dan a i pu un, bang ahia a muh i gen ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham in thilhih ziak a siam a tan ngalleh suan ding a nei ahi, Pathian ma ah zaw hi hetlou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Laisiangthou in bang a gen a? Abraham in Pathian a gingta a, huan huai ginna tuh a dikna a seh ahi chi in a gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan nasemmi loh tuh hehpihna a seh ahi kei a, bat a seh ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh nasem lou a, Pathian limsaklou siamtangsakpa gingta zaw mi ginna amah diktatna a seh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi a thilhih ngaihtuah lou a, Pathian in diktat a a seh, vual a zawlsak thu David in leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“A tatleknate ngaihdam a om a, a khelhnate uh khuh a omte, a hampha uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n khelhna nei a a sehlouhte a hampha uhi,” chi a a gen bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihleh huai vualzawlna zeksumte kia tung ah hia a om, zeksumloute tung ah leng? Abraham ginna a diktatna a seh ahi, i chi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai bangchi seh ahia? A zeksum nung in hia, a zeksum ma in? A zeksum nung in ahi kei a, a zeksum ma in ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in a zeksum ma in ginna ziak a diktatna a mu chih chiamtehna ding in zeksum thu a mu hi. Huchi a amah tuh zeksum lou, himahleh a gingtate diktatna sehsak a omte tengteng pa a hih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi mah bang a zeksumte kia hilou a, zeksum hilou a, i pa uh Abraham in zek a sum ma a ginna a neih bang ginna neite pa a hihtheihna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abraham leh a suante kiang a khovel gouluah ding ahi ding uh chih thuchiam zaw dan a kinga ahi kei a, ginna ziak a diktatna a kinga ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dan neimite gouluahte hi ding hile ubel, ginna bangmah in a phatuam kei a, thuchiam leng thuchiam ahita kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dan in thangpaihna a tun nak ngal a; himahleh dan omlouhna ah tatlekna leng a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in thuchiam hehpihna a piak a hihtheihna ding in ginna a kinga ahi, a suante tengteng in thuchiam pellou a a luah theihna ding un. Dan neimite kia’n a luah kei ding ua, Abraham neih bang ginna neite’n leng a luahsam ding uhi; amah i vek ua pa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Nam tampite pa in k’on bawlta” chi a gelh bang in, misite hihhing pa leh thil omloute om bang a genpa a gin Pathian mitmuh ah eite pa a bawl in a omzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lamet tuak a a omlouh in leng aman zaw lamen tak in a gingta a, “Chi tampite pa a hong hih theihna ding in: Tua bang in na suante a honghi ding uh,” chi a hilh a a om bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan ginna kiplou tuanlou in, a pumpi sisa bang a om tuh a ngaihtuah a, amah kum za vel mi ahi ngal a, Sarah ching leng a ngaihtuah sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian thuchiam ginglel in ginna tasam in a omkei a, Pathian a pahtawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A thuchiam a lohching sakthei chih a gingtaa, a ginna a hongkip zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in a ginna a diktatna a seh ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in a ginna a diktatna a seh ahi chih amah ziak kia a gelh ahi kei a, eite ziak in leng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesu i Toupa misi lak a kipan a kaithoupa gingtate i hi. I ginna tuh diktatna a seh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu i tatlekna ziak a matsaka om, siam i tanna ding a kaihthoh a om ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ginna ziak a siamtansak a om in i Toupa Jesu Khrist pansan in Pathian toh kilem in i om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah tawn mah in hiai hehpihna ah i lut ua; huai ading in Pathian thupina i tan ding lametna ah kipak in i om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai kia leng hilou in, i gimthuakna ah leng kipak in i om uh, gimthuakna in kuhkalna a tun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kuhkalna in theihtelna a tun a, theihtelna in lametna a tun chih thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan lametna in a hon zahlaksak kei a, huai Kha Siangthou i kiang ua honpiak tawn a Pathian itna i lungtang ua sun a a omtak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I hat nailouh lai in a huntak in Khrist Pathian limsakloute sih sik in a hong sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi dik sik a sih, mi a ut ngelkei hial ding ua, mi hoih sik in bel mi kuahiam bek in sih a ngap khamawh kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian in mikhialte i hih lai a Khrist i sik a a sihna ah a hon itna a langsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in a sisan a siamtansak a i omkhit nung in, amah ziak in Pathian hehna , a kipan hotdam in i om ngei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Melma i hihlai a bawn a Tapa sihna ziak a Pathian toh na kitam khin i hih ngal un tuh, kitam a i omkhit nung un a hinna ziak in hotdam in i omsem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi kia leng ahi kei a, kitamna tua hon musakpa i Toupa Jesu Khrist ziak in Pathian ah leng i kipak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in mi khat ziak in khelhna khovel ah a lut a, khelhna ziak in sihna a lut a, mi tengteng a khelh ziak un sihna in mi tengteng a zelsuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dan om ma in khovel ah khelhna a om khin ngal a; dan a omlouh lai in khelhna tuh khelhna a sim ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh Adam om a kipan Mosi om pha in Adam tatlekna bang a thil hihkhialloute tung ah leng sihna in vai a hawm zel hi. Adam tuh hongpai ding tehpihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh thilthawnpiak zaw tatlekna toh a kibang kei. Mi khat tatlekna ziak a mi tampi a sih ua leh Pathian hehpihna leh mi khat Jesu Khrist hehpihna thawnpiak a kiching zawsem a mi tampi tung a vuh in a om hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan thilthawnpiak mi khat tatlekna gah toh leng a kibang sam kei hi. Mi khat tatlekna tung a vaihawmna in siamlouh tansakna a tun a, mi tampi tatlekna tung a thilthawnpiak in bel siamtansakna a tun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi khat tatlekna ziak a sihna in huai mi khat mah pansan a vai a hawm leh, hehpihna kiningching mahmah leh diktatna thawnpiak tangte’n mi khat Jesu Khrist pansan in hinna a vai a hawm zawsem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan mi khat tatlekna in mi tengteng ading a siamlouh tansakna a tut mah bang in, mi khat diktatna thilhih in mi tengteng ading in suahtakna leh hinna a hontun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangziak hiam i chih leh, mi khat thumanlouhna ziak a mi tampi mikhial a bawl a hih bang un, mi khat thumanna ziak in mi tampi mi diktat a bawl ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khelhna latsak semna ding in Dan a hongom behlap a; himahleh khelhna a khanna peuh ah hehpihna a khang sem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi a khelhna in sihna a vai a hawm mah bang, hehpihna in leng i Toupa Jesu Khrist pansan a diktatna ziak a tangtawn hinna dong a vai a hawm theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bang i genta dia leh? Hehpihna a khansem theihna ding in khelhna ah i om nilouh ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Om nilouh lou hial ding. Eite khelhna lam a sisa, khelhna ah bangchi’n i hing thei lailai dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eite Khrist Jesu a baptist lut a om tengteng a sihna ah baptist lut in i om chih na theikei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaiziak in a sihna a baptist lut a om in amah toh vuikhawm in i om uhi, huchi a Pa thupina in misi lak a kipan a Khrist a kaihthohtak bang a eite leng hinna thak a i khosak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sihna kibatpih a amah toh i kizopkhit ngal leh, a thohnawnna kibatpih in leng i kizom sam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I mihing lui a kiang ah kilhden in a om samta chih i thei; huchi a khelhna pumpi hih manthat a a om theihna ding leh tua kipan a khelhna sikha a i om louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kuapeuh sisa khelhna lak ah a suakta ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan Khrist toh i sihsam leh, a kiang ah i hingsam ding chih gingta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khrist misi lak a kipan kaihthoh in a omta, a si nawn kei ding chih i thei ngal uhi; sihna in amah tung ah thu a neita kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sihna khelhna lam thu ah tangtawn adin khatvei kia a si ahi, a hinna bel Pathian lam thu ah a hing ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in, nou leng khelhna lam thu ah sisa in kisep unla, Pathian lam thu ah bel Khrist Jesu ah hing in kisep un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in na pumpi uh duhgawlna thumang ding in na pumpi si thei uah khelhna vaihawmsak kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na pumpi hiangte uh leng diktatlouhna vanzat ding in khelhna kiang ah pe phal sam kei un; himahleh misi lak a kipan hing nawn bang in Pathian kiang ah kipia unla, na pumpi hiangte uh leng diktatna vanzat ding in Pathian kiang ah pe phal zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Noute danthunuai om hilou a, hehpihna a nuai a om na hih ziak un khelhna in na tung uah thu a nei nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangchi’n ahi dia leh? Dan thunuai a om i hi kei ua, hehpihna nuai a om i hih zawk ziak in i khial ding uh ahi diam? Hilou hial ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kua kiang peuh ah leng a thumang ding a a sikha dia na kipiak un sihna khop a khelhna sikha hiam, diktatna khop a thumang sikha hiam, a thu na man uh sikha na hi uh chih na theikei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian kiang ah kipahthu om hen; noute khelhna sikha na hitamah le uchin, thuginpi a na kipiakna uh na lungtang taktak un na zuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khelhna lak a kipan suahtak sak in na omta ua, diktatna sikhate na hong hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na sa uh hatlouh ziak in mihing dan in thu ka gen hi; na sa hiangte uh nitna leh tatlekna ding a tatlekna kiang a sikha dia na piak phal bang un, tuin na sa hiangte uh siangthouna ding in diktatna kiang ah sikha ding in pe zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khelhna sikhate na hihlai un diktatna lak ah na siang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua na thil zahpih sate uah, huailai in gah bang ahia na muhzel uh? Huai thilte tawpna zaw sihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tun ah bel khelhna lak a hihsiang a om in, Pathian sikhate na hong hih un, siangthouna mu khop in na gah uh na nei uh a kei hiam, huai tawpna tangtawn a hinna toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khelhna man sihna ahi ngal a, Pathian thilthawnpiak bel i Toupa Khrist Jesu ziak in tangtawn a hinna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahihleh unaute aw, dan in mi a damsung teng a tung ah vai a hawm nak chih na theikei ua hia? Dan thei mite kiang ah ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Numei, pasal nei a pasal a damsung teng a pasal dan a hen in a om a; himahleh a sih in bel pasal lam ah dan a kipan khah in a om ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in a pasal damsung a midang a kitenpih leh, Angkawm, chih ahi ding hi; a pasal a sih in bel huai dan a kipan khah in a om a, huchi in midang nei leh leng angkawm ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, Pathian lam a i gah theihna ding in midang, misi lak a kipan kaihthoh ngeingei na kitenpih theihna ding un, Khrist pumpi pansan in danlam ah sihsakin na omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sa a i omlai un dan ziak a khelhna utna hong suakte’n, i sahiangte ah sihna khopa gah ding in a semnak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin bel hon lenpa lak ah sikhinin, dan a kipan khah in i omta, laigelh lui bang hilou a, Kha a hinna thaka na i sep theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bang i genta dia leh? Dan khelhna hia? Hilou hial. Himahleh, dan tawn a theih hi kei leh khelhna theilou ding hi’ng a; dan in, “Eng ken” chi kei leh, eng chih theilou ding hi’ng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh khelhna in, thupiak ziak in, lemtan lai mu in enna chiteng ka sung ah a omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dan lou in khelhna si ahi. Tuma lam in kei danlou in ka hing a; himahleh thupiak a hongom tak in khelhna a honghalh a, kei ka sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan hinna thuchiam nei thupiak kei adin sihna a honghi chih ka na theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khelhna in thupiak ziak in, lemtan lai mu in honkhem a, thupiak zang in a hon hihlumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in dan a siangthou hi, thupiak leng a siangthou a, a dik a, a hoih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihleh thil hoih kei adin sihna a honghi ahia? Hilou hial. Khelhna kei din sihna a honghi zaw ta ahi. Huchi in khelhna, khelhna ahi chih a lat theihna ding in thil hoih zang in a honthat ahi; thupiak ziak a khelhna, khelhna thupitak a honghih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dan khalam thil ahi chih i thei ngal ua, kei bel sami, khelhna a khotsa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil ka hih pen, a dan ka theikei; ka thilhih zel pen, ka thilhih utlam ahi ngal kei a, ka thil huatlam tak ka hih zawnak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hih utlouh lam ka hih ngal in, dan a hoih chih pompih ka hi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaichiang in, ka thilhihpen keimah hih ahita kei a, khelhna keimah a om hih ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keimah ah, huai bel ka sa ah, thil hoih himhim a teng kei chih ka thei: thil hoih hih utna keimah ah a om na a, thil hoih ka hihthei kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hoihna hih ka ut pen ka hih kei a, khelhna hih ka utlouhpen, ka hih zawnak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka utlouh lam pen ka hih ngal chiang in, a hihpa kei ka hita kei a, khelhna keimah a om pen ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in hiai dan k’on theita hi; thil hoih hih ka ut lai in gitlouhna ka kiang ah a hongom nak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka lungsim taktak in Pathian dan tung ah ka kipak ngal nak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh ka sahiangte ah dan tuam a om chih ka thei, huai in ka lungsim dan a dou a, ka sahiangte a khelhna dan om kiang ah sal in a honpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi genthei hina lawmlawm ing e! Hiai sihna pumpi apan kuan ahia hon suakta sak ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu Khrist i Toupa ziak in Pathian kiang ah kipahthu ka gen ahi. Huchi in keimah takinzaw ka lungsim in Pathian dan ka sem a, ka sa in gitlouhna dan a sem hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tun ah zaw Khrist Jesu a omte ading in siamlouh tansakna himhim a omta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a Hinna Kha dan in khelhna leh sihna dan a kipan hon suaktasak ta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sa ziak a dan a hatlouh a, ahihtheih vuallouh, Pathian in, amah Tapa ngei, khelhna sa gilou bang pu in, khelhna thoihna dia honsawl in, sa a khelhna om tuh siamlouh a tangsak ta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sa dan zuilou a Kha dan zui zawte eimah a dan in a ngiat diktatna tangtun a a om theih na ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sa dan a omte’n sa lam thilte a lunggulh nak uh; Kha dan a omte’n bel Khalam thilte a lunggulh nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sa thilte deih zaw sihna ahi ngal a, Kha thil deih bel hinna leh khamuanna ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sa deihdan zaw Pathian douna a hih ziak in. Huai Pathian dan in a om ngalkei a, om leng a om theikei him ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in, sa a omte’n Pathian a kipaksak theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian Kha noumau a a omtaktak leh, sa a om na hi kei ua, Kha a om na hi zaw uhi. Himahleh, kuapeuh Khrist Kha neilou zaw amah a ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khrist Kha noumau a a om ngal leh, khelhna ziak in pumpi a si ahi; kha tuh dikna ziak in a hing ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh misi lak a kipan Jesu kaithou nawnpa Kha noumau a a om leh, misi lak a kipan Khrist Jesu kaithou nawn pa’n, noumau a om a Kha pansan in na pumpi sitheite uh a hihhing sam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in unaute aw, bat i nei; sa dan a om ding in sa lak ah bel ahi kei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sa dan a na om uleh, na si mahmah ding uhi; himahleh pumpi thilhihte Kha a na hihlup zel uleh na hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian Kha pi a om peuhmahte zaw, Pathian tate ahi ngal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lau a omnawn ding in sikha hihna kha na tang uh ahi ngal kei a; ta hihna kha na tang uh ahizaw. “Abba, Pa!” chi a i kikou chiang in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kha mahmah in, eimah kha toh, Pathian tate i hi chih hon theisak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan tate i hihleh gouluahpihte i hi uhi; Pathian gouluahte, Khrist luahpihte i hi ua; a kiang a pahtawi a i omsam theihna ding a amah i thuakpih taktak leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tulai a thuaknate denchiang a i tung a thupina hihlat a om ding toh tehpih tham in ka sep kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thilsiam tengteng in, lamen mahmah in, Pathian tate honglatna a ngaklah mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thilsiam tengtengte thil thulimlou thuthu a omsak in a omta uh; a ut ua om ahi kei ua, lametna a a omsakpa ziak ahizaw hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thilsiam tengteng leng siatna sikha a kipan suahtaksak in a om ding ua, Pathian tate noplenna thupi ah a lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thilsiam tengteng tutan in thum leh nauvei na thuak in a om uh chih i thei ngal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thilsiamte kia hilou in, eite ngei, Kha gahmasa tengte leng, ta hihna kilatna, i pumpi tatna ngak in i lungsim in i mau sam ngal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hiai lametna a hotdam i hi ngal ua. Himahleh muhtheih gige lametna zaw lametna ahi kei. Kuan a muhtheih gige a lamen a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I muhlouh pen i lamet lebel i ngak teitei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huai bang in, Kha in i hatlouhna ah hon huh zel a; bangchi a thum ding ahia chih i thei ngal kei ua; himahleh Kha in mauna gen vuallouh in hon thumsak zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian deihlam bangzel a misiangthoute a thum sak zel ziak in, lungtang enpan Kha deihlam a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian in a itte, aman a seh bang a a sapte adin, a hoihna ding un bangkim in a sepsak chiat chih i thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A theihkholhte amah Tapa bangtak a om ding in a sepkhol a, a Tapa unau tampite lak a ta masapen a hong hih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huan a sehkholhte a sam a; huan a sapte siam a tangsak lai a; siam a tansakte a pahtawi lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huai thu ah bang i genta dia leh? Pathian eilam a apan leh kuan ahia honzou thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amah Tapa ngei leng hawilou a, i vek ua ding a pepan thil tengteng a thawn in a honpe tawk kei dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian mitelte kuan ahia hek ding? Siamtangsakpa Pathian ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kuan ahia siamlouh tangsak ding? Si pen Khrist Jesu ahi ngal a; ahi, a thounawn zawta a, Pathian taklam a om a hon gensakpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khrist itna a kipan kuan ahia honkhen ding? Gimthuakna in hia, lungngaihna in hia, sawina in hia, taam in hia, vuaktanna in hia, lauhhuaina in hia, namsau in hia honkhen ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Nangmah ziak in nitum in thah in ka om uh; belam goh dingte bang a sim ka hi uh” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Khenlou hial ding, huaite tengteng ah, hon itpa ziak in, vualtungtuangte sang a tungtuang zaw i hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sihna hiam, hinna hiam, angelte hiam, thupinate hiam, thil omlelte leh thil hongom dingte hiam thilhihtheihna leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Sanna, thukna leh thilsiam dangte himhim in leng, i Toupa Khrist Jesu a om Pathian itna a kipan, honkhen theikei ding chih diktak in ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khrist ah thu taktak ka gen ahi, ka zuau kei, Kha Siangthou ah ka sialehpha theihna in leng hon theihpih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lungtang ah haksatna thupitak leh lunggaihna dai theilou ka pai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka unaute salam a ka chipihte sik in, kei pen Khrist a kipan hihtuam khop hial in hamsethuak in om leng ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel mi ahi ngal ua; ta hihna, thupina leh thukhun tengteng, dan piakna leh Pathian nasepna a thuchiam tengteng amau a ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pipute leng amau a ahi ua, salam thu ah Khrist leng amau a kipan a hongpawt ahi a; amah thil tengteng tung a om, tangtawn a phattuak Pathian ahi. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian thu bangmahlou bang a omta ahi kei hi. Israel suante Israel mi ahivek kei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abraham suante a hih ziak un avek un a tate leng ahi kei uhi; “Isak ah na suante a kiminloh ding” chih ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai sa tate Pathian tate ahi kei ua, thuchiam tate Abraham suan a seh ahizaw uh, chihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuchiam pen hiai ahi: “Tu hun bang in ka hong dia, Sarah in tapa a nei ding.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai phet ahi kei Rebeka in leng i pu Isak lak a nau a pailai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Naupangte a pian ma un, sialehpha a theihma un, thilhih ziak hilou in, a sampa deih ziak hi zaw in, tel lam thu ah Pathian thu seh a kip theihna ding in a kiang ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“A upa zaw in a naupang zaw nna a sem ding” Pathian in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Jakob ka it a, Esau zaw ka hua” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bang i genta ding ua leh? Pathian ah diktatlouhna a om ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Omlou hial. Aman, “Ka hehpih peuhmah ka hehpih dia, zah ka ngaihna tung peuhmah ah zah ka ngai ding” chi in, Mosi kiang ah a genta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in, a deihpa ziak ahi kei a, a taipa ziak leng ahi sam kei a, a hehpihpa Pathian ziak ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Laisiangthou in Pharo kiang ah, “Hiai ziak tak in ahi k’on tunding, nang a ka thilhihtheihna ka taklat theihna ding leh leitung tengteng a ka min a than theihna ding in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian in a ut peuhmah a hehpih a, a ut peuhmah a genhak sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nou ka kiang ah, bangdia mawh a hondem ahia? A deihlam kuan kalh ahia? honchi ding na hih tuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi a, mihing aw, nang Pathian nial vialpa kua na hia leh? Thilsiam in a siampa kiang ah “Bang achia hichibang a hon siam” a chi dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bellei tang khat apan bel khat kilawm tak, manphatak a zat ding leh manphalou deuh a zat ding bawl din belvelpa’n bellei tung ah thu a neikei ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian in a hehna leh a thilhihtheihna latsak a ut a, a hehna thuak ding a hihsiat a om ding a a bawlkholhte tung a a hehpihna hauhdan a latsak a a thuakzoh teitei leh bang a poi a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi a a thupina hauhsaknate, a zahngaihna thupina tang ding a a bawlkholhte tung a a sunbuak leh a latsak theihna ding in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaite tuh eite i hi ua, huai hehpihna belte Judate lak a kipan kia hilou a, Jentelte lak a kipan a leng sapte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hosea laibu ah: “Ka mite hi ngeilou, ka mite, ka chi dia; it ngeilouhnu leng itnu, ka chita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Huan hichi a honghi ding a, a kiang ua, ka mite na hi kei uh a chihna mun ngei ah Pathian hing tate chih in a om ding uh, chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isai in leng Israel mite thu kikou pih in, “Israel mite zaw tuipi piaunel zah in tam mahle uh, a sibang kia hotdam in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Toupa’n kintak a hihzou vek in leitung ah a gawt ding thu a tangtun dek ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isai in, Mipite “Toupa’n chisuah ding hon na hawi saklou hileh Sodom khua bang in i na omta ding ua, Gomorrah khua bang a bawl in i na omta ding uh” chi a a genkholh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bang i genta dia leh? Jentel, diktatna delhloute’n, ginna ziak a diktatna tuh a na phata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel, diktatna dan delhte’n, diktatna pen a pha zouta kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bangziak in ahia? Ginna in a delhkei ua, thilhih a muhtheih bang in a delh ziak uh ahi. Pukna suang ah a pukta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Laisiangthou in: “Ngai in, Zion ah kisuihna suang leh pukna suangpi ka koih a, kuapeuh amah gingta tuh a zahlak kei ding” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute aw, ka lungtang deihlam leh amau adia Pathian kiang a ka thumna pen zaw, hotdam a hong hihtheihna ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian lam ah phatuam a ngai uh chih ka theihpih ahi, himahleh theihna ahihvak in zaw ahi kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian diktatna theilou in, amau diktatna lamkhiak a tum ua, Pathian diktatna ah a kipe lut sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khrist bel a gingta peuhmahte adin diktatna a muh theihna ding un dan tawpna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosi in, “Dan a diktatna zui zaw, huai diktatna ziak in a hing ding” chi in a gelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ginna a diktatna in bel huchi in a gen: “Na lungsim in, kua ahia van ah kah ding? Hiam, ‘tunglam a kipan Khrist va pisuk ding’ chihna ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kua ahia khukthuk a hohsuk ding? Hiam, ‘huai bel misi lak a kipan Khrist pitou nawn ding’ chihna ahi, chi ken” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihleh, bang ahia a gen? “Thu in a honnaih hi, na kam leh na lungtang ah a om” chi in, a gen ahi; huai ginna thu ka gen pen uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kam a Jesu Toupa ahi chih na gup a, misi lak a kipan Pathian in a kaithou chih na lungtang a na gintak leh hotdam in na om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Min lungtang in a gingta ua, diktatna a mu uhi; kam in a gum ua, hotdamna leng a mu nak uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Laisiangthou in, “Kuapeuh amah gingta a zahlak kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Juda leh Grik mite bangmah ah a lamdang tuankei ua, Toupa khat avek ua tung ah Toupa ahi a, a minlou peuhmahte tung ah hoihna a hau ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kuapeuh Toupa minlou tuh hotdam in a om ding” chih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihleh, a gintaklouhpi uh bangchi’n a lou ding ua? A thu a zaklouhpi uh bangchi’n a gingta ding ua? Thuhilhmi omlou in bangchi’n a za ding ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sawl ahihkei uleh bangchi’n thu a hilh ding ua? “Thil hoih tanchin kipahhuai tunte khe kilawm natel e!” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh Tanchinhoih avek un a ngaikhe kei uhi. Isai in “Toupa, ka thugen uh kuan ahia gingta?” a chih bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in ginna tuh zakna ziak in a hongom a, zakna Khrist thu kigen ziak in a hongom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihleh a bil un a za kei ua hia? Za nake; “A husa uh gamchih ah a thang a, a thu uh kawlmong pha in a thangsuakta” chih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihleh, Israel mite’n a za kei ua hia? “Mipi dia gentham louhte k’on haza sak dia; nam pilloute zang in k’on hehsak ding,” chi in, Mosi in a gen masapen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan Isai in hangsantak in, “Hon zongloute muh in ka omta; hon kanloute ka kimusakta” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh Israel mite thu ah, “Mi chihmawh leh selhatte din sun nilouh in ka ban ka zak hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahihleh Pathian in a mite a paikhia ahia? Paikhelou hial. Keileng Israel mi, Abraham suan, Benjamin nam ka hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in a mi a theihkholhte a paikhe kei hi. Laisiangthou in Elijah thu a gen na theikei ua hia? Aman Israel mite tungthu Pathian kiang ah a tun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Toupa na zawlneite a that ua, na maitamte a hihchim ua; keimah kia nutsiat in ka om, keileng hon hihlup a hontum uhi” a chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian in bangchi’n a dawng a? “Baal ma a khukdin ngeilou mi sang sagih keimah ading in ka hawi hi” chi in, a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchibang in tulai in leng a sibang, hehpihna a tel a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hehpihna ziak ahihleh, nasep ziak ahita kei, huchi ahihkei leh, hehpihna tuh hehpihna ahita kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangchi ahita dia leh? Israel mite’n a zon uh a mu kei uh. Telte’n bel a mu uh, a dangte tengteng a nang gawp ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Pathian in tunitan in a kiang uah lusukna kha a pia a, muh theihlouhna mitte, zak theihlouhna bilte toh” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in, “A dohkan uh amau a ding in thang leh pial, pukna leh phulakna honghi hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A theihlouhna ding un a mitte uh hong mial hen, nang a nungzang uh kunsak gige in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihleh a kisuih uh a kipuk den na ding uhia? Hilou hial ding. A puk ziak un Jentelte kiang ah hotdamna a hongtung zawta hi, Israel mite hazat ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in a pukna u bawn khovel hih hauhsakna a hih a, a kiamna uh bawn Jentelte hauhsakna ahihleh, a buchin nawnna uh bangchi phet a hamphatna lianzaw in a zui diam aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in nou Jentelte kiang ah ka gen ahi. Kei Jentelte kiang a sawltak ka hih ziak in, ka nasepna pen ka pahtawi ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi a ka chipihte ka hazat saktheih teitei na ding leh a lak ua khenkhatte ka hotdam theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amau paihkhiakna bawn khovel toh kituahnawnna ahihleh, amau deih nawn na ding sihna a kipan hin nawnna loungal bang ahi dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, gah masa thillat, tangbuang mekthem a sianthou leh huchi mah bang in a beupi a siangthou hi; a zungpi a siangthou leh a hiangte leng huchi mah bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiang khenkhat te hihtan a a om in, nang olive taklou, amau lak a phuhlut in na om a, olive sing a hauhna zung kikoppih sam na hihman in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiang dangte lak ah kisathei ken. Kisathei mahle chin nang a zung vakpa na hi kei a, huai a zung nang honvakpa ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan nang “Phuhlut a ka om theihna ding in hiangte hihtan in a om khinta vaw oi” na chi dia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi a gintaklouhna ziak un hihtan in a om ua, nang na ginna ziak in na ding ahi, uang kenla, lau zaw in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian in hiangtakte pen bawn a hawi kei ngal leh, nang leng a honhawi tuankei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian hoihna leh a thukhauhna ngaihtuah in: a pukte ading a a thukhauhna; nang ading in bel a hoihna, hoihna a na om gige leh; huchi ahihkei leh nang leng satkhiak in na omsam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan amau leng gingtalou a a om nilouh kei uleh, phuhlut in a om nawn ding uh; Pathian in amau a phutlut nawn thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nang piandan a olive taklou a kipan a satsup bawn, piandanlou bang a olive sing hoih a phutlut a na om leh, tua a hiangtakte, amau olive sing ngei ah phutlut hina tel un chia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Unaute aw, hiai thuguk na theihlouh uh ka utkei a, huchilou in zaw na kipilsak ding uh: Jentelte buchinna a hongtun masiah Israel mi khenkhatte tung ah siatna a hongtung tadih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in Israel mi tengteng hotdam in a om ding uh: “Zion a kipan in Hondampa a hongsuak ding a, Jakob kiang a kipan Pathian limsaklouhna a hihmang ding”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Hiai a kiang ua ka thukhun ding hiai ahi, a khelhnate uh ka lakmang chiang in” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tanchinhoih lam ngaihtuah in, nou ziak in melma ahi ua; tel thu lam ngaihtuah in bel a pipute uh ziak in deihtakte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian in a thilthawnpiak ah leh a sapna ah a lungsim a khel ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nidanglai in Pathian thu na gingkei ua, himahleh tuin amau a ginlouh ziak un zahngaihna na mu ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in tuin, Pathian in nou a hon hehpihna ziak a, zahngaihna a muhtheihna ding un amau leng ginglou eita ve ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pathian in a hehpih vek theihna ding in mi tengteng ginlouhna ah a khumvekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian pilna leh theihna hauhdanthuk hina tel e! A vaihawmnate theihtheih vual leh, a lampite suizoh vual hi keina tel e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Toupa lungsim kua’n ahia thei? Kuan a vaihawm sak a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“A ditnawn ding in leng a kiang ah kuan ahia thil pe masa?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amah a kipan leh amah ziak leh amah ading in thil tengteng a hongom ahi ngal a; amah kiang ah tangtawn in thupina om hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in unaute aw, Pathian zahngaihna ziak in, kithoihna hing, siangthou leh Pathian lungtuak ding in na sapum uh lan ding in k’on ngen ahi; huai na biakna dan ding him uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai khovel dan bang in omkei unla; Pathian deihlama hoih leh, lungtuahhuai tak leh hoihkim na theihtel theihna ding un, na lungsim uh a thaka om in hong lamdang zawta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lak uah kuamah na kilet sak ding hun val ua kiliansak lou in, Pathian in michih kiang a ginna hun a piak bangzel a diktak a ngaihtuah zaw ding in Pathian in honpiak hehpihna ziak in k’on chi chiat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sapum khat ah hiang tampi i nei ua, hiang tengteng nasep bel a kibang kei hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />huchi mah bang in, eite tampi himah lehang Khrist ah sapum khat ihi ua: a tuamtuam in i ki hiangtuah chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hehpihna a honpiak dan bangzel in thilthawnpiak tuamtuam i neichiat uhi: thugen ding ahihleh i ginna toh kihun in i gen ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nasep ding ahihleh na i sem chiatchiat ding uh; thuhilhmi’n leng hilh hiathiat hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Taihilhmi’n leng taihilh geihgeih hen; thilpemi’n itlou in pia hen; vaihawmmi’n thanuam tak in hawm hen; mi hehpih in kipaktak in hehpih hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Itna ahihleh lepchiahna tellou in hi hen. Gilou hua unla, hoih lam len chinten un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Unaute it lam ah ittak in kilainat tuahchiat un; pahtawi lam ah, kideihsak tuah chiat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thanop lam ah, thadah kei un; Kha a vakna toh phatuamngai in Toupa nna sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lametna ah kipak unla; gimthuakna ah kuhkal unla; thumna ah thum teitei unla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Misiangthoute taksapna ah taksap awnghu unla; mikhualte kipahpih in om nilouh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Honsawite vualzawl unla, vualzawl unla, hamsiat kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kipakte kipahpih unla, kapte kahpih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngaihtuah kibang in omchiat un, kingaihtuah sang lawkei unla, mi neuneu kithuahpih zaw un. Kipilsak kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kua gitlouh leng gilou in thuk kei un. Mi tengteng muh in thil kilawm ngaihtuah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A theih liai leh noumau lambek, mi tengteng toh kituak in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Deihtakte aw, phu kila kei unla, Pathian hehna awn zaw un, “Phulak himhim keimah lak ding ahi, ken ka thukna ding, Toupa’n a chi” chih gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huaiziak in, “Na melma a gilkial leh nekding pia inla; a dangtak leh dawn ding pia in; huchibang a na hihleh a lutung ah mei am na sekkhawm ahi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gitlouh zoh in om kenla, hoihna in gilou zou zaw in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Michih a tung ua vaihawmte thuthu in om hen. Pathian thu lou in kuamah vaihawm a om ngalkei ua; vaihawmmite Pathian seh ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huaiziak in kuapeuh vaihawmmi sel Pathian seh kalh ahi; a selte’n amau tung ah vaihawmna a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaihawmte thil hoih hihte ding in kihtakhuai ahi kei uhi; thil hoihlou hihte ding in bel kihtakhuai ahi uhi. Ahihleh vaihawmmi kihtalou a om na ut uhia? Thil hoih hih le uchin phat na loh ding uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah tuh na hoihna ding ua Pathian nasemmi ahi ngal a. Himahleh kihta un, namsau lah a mawktawi ngalkei a; amah Pathian nasemmi, thil hihkhialmi tung a heh a phulami ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in Pathian hehna kihtakna ziak kia hilou in, na sialehpha theihna ziak un leng vaihawmmi thuthu in na om ding him uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiaiziakin siah leng na liau zel ve ua leh; huchibang thil ngei hih teitei ding in Pathian nasemmite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi tengteng kiang ah piak ding peuhmah pia un; leiman piakna ding kiang ah leiman pia unla, siah liauna dingpa kiang ah siah liau unla; kihtak dingpa leng kihta unla; zahtak dingpa leng zahtak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ki-ittuahna loungal, kuamah bangmah ba kei un; amau mihinpih itpa’n dan a zuikimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiaite, “Angkawm ken, Tualthat ken, Gu ken, Eng ken” chih leh, thupiak dang omlai himhimte, “Nangmah na ki-it bang in na invengte na it ding hi” chih in a khaikhawm vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Itna in a invengte a hihse ngeikei a; huaiziak in itna zaw dan zuih kimna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huailou in, tu bang hun ahia chih na thei ua, ihmu khanloh a hun mahmahta chih na thei uhi. Tun zaw i gintak tunglai sang in i hotdamna a nai zawta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zan a bei dekdek ta a, khua a vak dekta hi; huaiziak in mial a thilhihte paikhia in vak thuam in i kithuam ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sun a om bang in kilawm tak in i om ding uh, zu dawn buai leh zu kham a omlou in, huk leh kingaihhat a omlou in, kilai leh ki haza a omlou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa Jesu Khrist in kithuam zaw unla, na sa duhgawlna uh pichin ding in bangmah kibawl kei un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan ginna hatlou mi, a ngaihdante gense lou in ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi khat in thil bangkim nethei din a kigingta a, mi hatlou inbel anteh louhing kia a ne hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangkim nete’n a neloute simmawh kei henla; a neloute’n leng a nete gense kei heh; Pathian in amah a kipahpih khin ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Midang sikha gensepa kua na hia? A din leh a puk amah pu ading ahi. Himahleh amah zaw dinsak in a om ding, Toupa’n a dingsak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi khat in ni khat nidang sang in a sep thupi tuam a, midang in ni tengteng kibang chiat in a sep. Michih amah lungsim ah kitheichian hen aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni tangpan Toupa pahtawina ding in a tang hi. Huan bangkim nepa’n, Pathian kiang ah kipahthu a gen ziak in, Toupa pahtawina ding in a ne a; a neloupa’n leng Toupa pahtawina ding in a ne kei a, Pathian kiang ah kipahthu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kuamah eimah a dia hing i hi kei ua, kuamah eimah a dia si leng i hi sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I hin leh Toupa ading in i hing a; i sih in leng Toupa adia si i hi ngal a: huaiziak in i hin in leng, i sih in leng Toupa a i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khrist sihna leh a hinnawnna pen, mihing leh misi Toupa a hih theihna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh nang bang a chia na unau gensia na hia oi? Ahihkeileh nang bang a chia na unau simmawh na hia oi? Pathian thukhenna tutphah ma ah i vek un i ding ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Toupa’n mi tengteng ka ma ah a kun ding ua, lei tengteng leng Pathian kiang ah a kipulak ding uh chi in, ka chiam ahi” a chi, chih gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in, i vek un Pathian kiang ah eimah tanchin i gen chiat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in, kigense nawn keini, kuapeuh in a unau lampi ah kisuihna hiam dalna hiam koihlouh tum zaw hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah mawngmawng ah sianglou bangmah himhim a omkei chih Toupa Jesu ah ka thei mahmah hi; bangkhat sianglou a seh pen bel a seppa ading in a sianglou ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na banghiam nek ziak a na unau lungsim a nat leh, itna dan in na gamta kei ahi. A sih sik a Khrist in a sih sakpa na thilnek in hihmang kei hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in nou adia hoihna gilou lam a gen in omkei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian gam nek leh dawn thu hilou in Kha Siangthou a diktatna, kituahna leh kipahna ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kuapeuh huai thu ah Khrist nasem Pathian kipahpih leh mihing phat in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in kituahna ding leh kihihhat tuahna ding thilte i delh ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na thilnek ziak in Pathian nasep hihse ken. Thil tengteng a siangthou ngei a, himahleh na banghiam nek in mi a hihpuk leh a nepa ading in gilou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na unau pukna ding ahihleh, sa neklouhte, uain dawnlouhte, thil bangpeuh hihlouh a hoih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ginna na neih Pathian ma ah nangmah kia theih in nei mai in. Amah hoih saklam a siamlouh kitangsak lou tuh a hampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh in ginglelpa’n a nek leh, ginna a a neklouh ziak in, siamlouh a tang hi; bangpeuh ginna lou a hih zaw khelhna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in ei a hatte’n, eimah kipahna zong lou in, a hatloute hatlouhnate i thuak pih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eimah invengte hih phattuamna ding in a hoihna ding un kipahsak i tum chiat ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khrist in leng amah kipahna a zong ngal kei a; “Nang hon taite taina ka tung ah a tuta” chih gelh bang in ahizaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Laisiangthou a kuhkalna leh khamuanna mu a lametna i neih theihna ding un, nidanglai a gelh peuhmahte eite hon hilhna ding a gelh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuin kuhkalna leh khamuanna Pathian in, Khrist Jesu ah noute lungsim leh ngaihtuahna munkhat pu in hon omsak hen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi a, lungsim munkhat leh kituaktak a Toupa Jesu Khrist Pa, leh Pathian na pahtawi theihna ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in Khrist in Pathian thupina ding a noute a hon kipahpih mah bang in, khat leh khat kipahpihtuah chiat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin, pipute kiang a thuchiamte hihkipna ding in Khrist Pathian thutakdan theihsakna ding in zeksumte nasempa a hong hita chih na kiang uah ka gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hehpihna ziak a Jentelte’n Pathian a pahtawina ding un, “Huaiziak in Jentelte lak ah k’on phat dia, na min pahtawina ding in la ka sa ding,” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Huan nou Jentel tengtengte aw, a mite toh kipak un” a chi nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Nou Jentel tengtengte aw, Toupa phat un, mi tengteng in amah phat uhen” a chi nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isai in: “Jesse zungzam a hong khang ding a, Jentelte tung a vaihawm dingpa a hong dingkhe ding hi; amah ah Jentelte’n a lametna uh a koih ding uhi” a chilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kha Siangthou thilhihtheihna ziak a lametna na hauh theihna ding un, lametna Pathian, na gintak ziak un, kipahna leh kituahna chiteng in honhih dim hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan ka unaute aw, nou tungthu zaw noumau mah hoihna in na dim ua, na ki hanthawn tuahthei uh chih keimahtakin leng diktak in ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian in a honpiak hehpihna ziak in nou hon theihpih ding in koi kalkal hiam ah hangsantak in ka gelh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jentelte kiang a Khrist Jesu nasempa a ka om theihna ding in, Jentelte Kha Siangthou a hih siangthou a hih ua, pomtak a hih theihna ding un Pathian Tanchinhoih lam ah siampu na ka sem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian na ka sep lamthu ah Khrist Jesu ah kisaktheihna ding ka nei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khrist in Jentelte thumangsak ding a ka thugen leh nasepnate zang a a sepkhiakte loungal bangmah ka gen ngam ngal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chiamtehnate leh thillamdangte, thilhihtheihna ah, Kha Siangthou thilhihtheihna in Jerusalem khua leh a kim gam a kipan in, Illirikum gam pha in, Khrist Tanchinhoih gamchih ah ka hilh kimta; keimah hon zang a a thilhih tuh huchitel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi, midang suangphum tung a lem ka hihlouhna ding in, Tanchinhoih Khrist min lohkhitna mun a genlou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“A tanchin gen ngeilouhnate’n a mu ding ua, za ngei nailoute’n a za ding uh” chih gelh bang in, gen ka tum zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in ahi, na kiang ua hong ka kikhel sak naknak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuin bel hiai gam kim ah sepna mun himhim ka neita kei a, kum tampi na kiang ua hong ut in leng ka omta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Spain gam a ka hoh chiang in ka pai kawm a nou honmuh ka kilamen ngal a, noumau toh kithuah khawm phot in, maban ka paina ding ah noute’n n’on vakhak suk uh leng ka lamen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin bel, misiangthoute nasem ding in Jerusalem khua ah ka hoh tadih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Masidonia leh Akhaia gam a mite’n kipaktak in Jerusalem khua a misiangthoute lak a gentheite adin thilpiakte a pe chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiai thilpiak in amau nakpi’n kipaksak hi; amau ding in leng bat ahi him hi; Jentelte’n Judate khalam Vualzawlna a kikoppih ua leh, salam thil a amaute taksap awng a huksak sam uh a kilawm him ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huaiziak in huai ka hih a, gah leng amaute diktak a ka muhsak nung in, noute hontawn in, Spain gam ah ka pai zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huan na kiang ua ka hong chiang in, Khrist tanchinhoih vualzawlna kim pu in ka hongding chih ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Unaute aw, Pathian kiang a n’on thumsak na uah, hon thumpih teitei ding in Toupa Jesu Khrist leh Kha Siangthou itna in nget petmah in k’on ngen ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Juda gam a gingloute lak a ka bit theihna ding leh, Jerusalem khua adia huhna ka tawi misiangthoute kipahna lamtak a hihtheihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pathian hoihsak bang a nuamtak a na kiang ua ka hong a, i halh khawm vek theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lemna Pathian na vek ua kiang ah om hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I sanggamnu, Phoebi, Kenkriai khua a saptuamte nasem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa min a misiangthoute bang a nana kipahpihna ding uleh, na huh uh a kiphatmohna peuh a nana huh ding un hon kimeltheihsak ka ut ahi. Amahmah in leng mi tampi a na huh a, kei ngei leng a hon huhzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a hon huhte Priscilla leh Akuila chibai honbuk sak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau ka hinna humbitna ding in amau ngawngtan a ngap ua: amau tung kia ah kipahthu ka gen kei a, Jentel saptuam tengteng tung ah leng ka gen sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A inn ua saptuam kikhawmte leng chibai honbuk sak un. Ka deihtak, Epanita, Asia gam a Khrist gingta masapen, chibai honbuk sak un aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mari nou dia semgim, chibai honbuk sak un aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka chipih leh ka hentakpih, Andronika leh Junia, chibai honbuk sak un; amau sawltakte lak a minthang tak ahi ua, kei sang a Khrist a om masa zaw ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amplias, Toupa a ka deihtak, chibai honbuk sak un aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khrist a i naseppih uh Urbane leh ka deihtak Stakhis chibai hon buksak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khrist a mitak, Apelle, chibai honbuk sak un. Aristobula inkuanpihte lak a mite chibai honbuk sak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka chipih, Herodion, chibai honbuk sak un. Narkissa inkuanpihte lak a mi, Toupa a om, chibai honbuk sak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Triphaina leh Triphosa Toupa a semgimte, chibai hon buksak un aw. Deihtak Persi, Toupa a semgim mahmah sa chibai hon na buk sak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa tel Rufas leh a nu, kei nu sam leng, chibai hon na buk sak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinkaraita, Phligon, Hermas, Patroba, Hermes te a kiang ua unau omte toh, chibai hon na buksak un aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Philologas leh Julia, Nerias leh sanggamnu, Olimpa leh, a kiang ua Mi Siangthou om tengteng, chibai hon na buksak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tawp siangthou in chibai kibuk un. Khrist saptuam pawl tengteng in chibai honbuk chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan unaute aw, thuhilhna thu noumau hilhlouh lam a kikhenna leh pukna omsakte apan kiveng ding leh kiheisan ding in k’on ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchibang mite’n i Toupa Khrist na a sem kei ua, amau gilpi nna a sem zaw uhi; a kamphat uleh a kamsiam un mi pilloute lungtang a zekhem nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na omdan uh mi tengteng lak ah a thangkheta ngal a. Huaiziak in noumau tungthu ah ka kipak hi; himahleh, hoihlam a na pil ua, gilou lam a na pillouh uh ka deih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan lemna Pathian in na khepek nuai uah Setan a hon sikdensak pah ding hi. I Toupa Jesu Khrist hehpihna na kiang uah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka naseppih Timothi leh ka chipih Lusias leh Jason, Sosipaterte’n chibai a honbuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei Tertia, hiai laigelhtu in, Toupa min in chibai ka honbuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka tunnapa Gaias leh saptuam tengteng in chibai a honbuk uhi. Huai sum kempa Erata leh unaupa Kuartas in chibai a honbuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist hehpihna na vek ua kiang ah om hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin Amah, ka Tanchinhoih gen bang leh thuguk kilakna bangbang a Jesu Khrist ka tangkoupih bang a noute hon hihhattheipa, huai thuguk tanglai sawtpi mahmah sung selguk a na om mahleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tun bel ginna thumanna piangsak ding in zawlnei laibute zang a nam tengteng kiang a theihsak leh tangtawn Pathian thupiak bang in taklat in a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pilna Pathian kiang kia ah, Jesu Khrist tawn in thupina tangtawn dong in om hen! Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
